  <h2>Caveats</h2>
  <p>In certain unusual circumstances, some old avatars, which have a &quot;special&quot; status due to some kind of promotional package available during a period of time, <i>might</i> have bit 0x4000 set by mistake — possibly because such a flag hadn&#39;t been documented before and was inadvertently reused in April 2023 to flag automated agents. These perfectly regular <i>human</i> avatars are thus flagged as &#39;bots by LSL, as well as by the land management tools. This was reported as <a href="https://jira.secondlife.com/browse/BUG-234283" target="_blank">BUG-234283</a> and the solution seems to be to contact Linden Lab&#39;s support team.</p>
